    "sections": {
        "description": "Solar Business Kit is a modern solar energy and renewable energy WordPress theme for solar companies, solar panel installers, solar contractors, renewable energy providers, and clean energy businesses. Build a professional website for solar panel installation, residential and commercial solar, rooftop solar, solar power systems, solar EPC, battery storage, solar inverters, solar maintenance, and renewable energy services. It comes with 30+ pre-built sections and a ready-to-launch starter site that you can import with the one-click demo importer, making it easy to get your solar business website online quickly. Whether you need solar energy website templates, solar company website templates, renewable energy website templates, or a professional solar installation website, Solar Business Kit provides a flexible foundation to showcase your services, projects, solutions, testimonials, and company information. Built with the WordPress Block Editor, it makes it easy to customize every part of your website, from header to footer, without coding and create a professional online presence for your solar or renewable energy business. Explore features, demos, and more at https://cozythemes.com/solar-business-kit-solar-energy-wordpress-theme/"
    },
